		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Each row below scrolls in a seamless loop. Hover over a row to pause it. If your system asks for reduced motion, the rows stay still and wide ones can be scrolled by hand instead.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Images</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A full-width strip of images, scrolling left at 40 pixels per second, with faded edges and a 160px height limit.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

